{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09244","headline":"广陵遇孟九云卿 · 韦应物","name":"广陵遇孟九云卿","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"雄藩本帝都，游士多俊贤。\n夹河树郁郁，华馆千里连。\n新知虽满堂，中意颇未宣。\n忽逢翰林友，欢乐斗酒前。\n高文激颓波，四海靡不传。\n西施且一笑，衆女安得妍。\n明月满淮海，哀鸿逝长天。\n所念京国远，我来君欲还。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09244.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09244","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}